[34.7127, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n"]
[34.8295, "o", "Usage: coderabbit auth login [options]\r\n\r\nAuthenticate with CodeRabbit\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  --agent              Emit structured JSON output for agent-driven OAuth login\r\n  --self-hosted        Use self-hosted CodeRabbit instance\r\n  --no-browser         Open the login URL yourself using a browser that can reach this machine's localhost\r\n                       callback (port forwarding may be required)\r\n  --api-key <api-key>  Authenticate with a CodeRabbit API key\r\n  --region <region>    Use CodeRabbit's US or EU region (choices: \"us\", \"eu\")\r\n  -h, --help           display help for command\r\n"]
[34.8296, "o", "\r\nExamples:\r\n  coderabbit auth login                         # Interactive login with browser\r\n  coderabbit auth login --agent                 # Agent-friendly OAuth login with JSON output\r\n  coderabbit auth login --agent --no-browser    # Manually open the URL with localhost access\r\n  coderabbit auth login --self-hosted           # Self-hosted instance login\r\n  coderabbit auth login --region eu             # Authenticate with CodeRabbit EU\r\n  coderabbit auth login --api-key \"<api-key>\"   # Store an API key for CLI reviews\r\n  coderabbit auth login --region eu --api-key \"<api-key>\" # Store an EU API key\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n  --agent is only supported for localhost browser callbacks and never accepts pasted OAuth tokens.\r\n"]
[34.8317, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[7m%\u001b[27m\u001b[1m\u001b[0m                                                                                                               \r \r"]
